      "content": "idk what to do anymore. everything is just gone. the bank called again today and i cant even look at my phone without feeling like i'm gonna throw up. i've worked so hard for everything and now it's just... over. i feel like there's literally no way to fix this. i'm just stuck in this corner and there's no exit.",
